Package: timescales
Title: Nested Timeframes and Calendars for Optimization and Simulation Models
Version: 0.7.0
URL: https://optimal2050.github.io/timescales/r/,
    https://optimal2050.github.io/timescales/,
    https://github.com/optimal2050/timescales
BugReports: https://github.com/optimal2050/timescales/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Oleg",
           family = "Lugovoy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "olugovoy@optimalsolution.dev",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5546-9875"))
Description: Provides discrete temporal representations for optimization and
    simulation models. A calendar records ordered timeframes, their members
    and duration-weighted timeslices, including full-resolution,
    representative-period and fiscal-year designs. Maps timestamps to
    timeslices, joins calendar labels to tabular data, and recasts values
    between temporal resolutions using explicit aggregation and
    disaggregation rules. Includes a catalog of predefined calendars and
    visualization helpers for calendar structures and time-series data.
    Extends 'nestedscales' with temporal semantics.
